{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Parallel Fan-Out and Join.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Parallel Fan-Out and Join.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"parallel fan out and join parallel fan out and join","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Parallel Fan-Out and Join.md","fileName":"Parallel Fan-Out and Join.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Parallel Fan-Out and Join","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-13 20:16\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Computational Methods and Formalization]] [[.NET Server Concurrency and Parallel Patterns]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Computational Methods and Formalization",".NET Server Concurrency and Parallel Patterns","computationalthinking.epub","hands-onparallelprogrammingwithc8andnetcore3.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Parallel Fan-Out and Join.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Parallel Fan-Out and Join.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"parallel fan out and join parallel fan out and join","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Parallel Fan-Out and Join.md","fileName":"Parallel Fan-Out and Join.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Parallel Fan-Out and Join","heading":"Parallel Fan-Out and Join","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A fan-out-and-join computation distributes independent pieces of work to many workers or processors and later combines their results. Fan-out creates parallel activity; join waits for the required outputs and assembles them into the next stage.\n\nThe pattern can reduce elapsed time when work is sufficiently independent. Its benefits are limited by uneven task sizes, communication overhead, shared resources, and the need to validate results before joining them.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Computational Methods and Formalization",".NET Server Concurrency and Parallel Patterns","computati